1</span>: The stockholders did approve an amendment to the Certificate of Incorporation to effect a reverse stock split of the Company&#8217;s
outstanding common stock by combining outstanding shares into a lesser number of shares at a ratio of not less than 1-for-2 and not greater
than 1-for-30, with the exact ratio to be set within that range at the discretion of the Board. The results of the vote were as follows:</span></p>

